e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2RQtzZSfpQsQ7kNvwGG4xbF&_nc_oc=AdpnXdjZLG5yJUVh27nhnLLzohgTZpw41A76MBEuROJy7DrxJegQC_WJOgdEHcwJq7U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJt9fiK02wpIjscac7YIbgTCdZxZn6HjvepYQMKhblPIw&oe=6AA6BC79"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cD88j9tDrPwQ7kNvwH7n_8q&_nc_oc=AdqLFJocCKPtNy5zTUGJ-FruqBAFBGZJAiTEh1L25uwYiegjA8mnGoUZirKZINCKsiw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLHhHpDK3JJtpWUntbglhKDnxUwkT7F6ORjH7kwaaWrMg&oe=6AA693D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lNnNeZ6JCJsQ7kNvwGMq8Pq&_nc_oc=Adp4LRuGWWB_upOM6YSDE83-shTSZ468v9Ijhfp8tTgQYQXnbc-7DGZ9TnQ9xnO5bjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJhaxgJHeQvOBMkTOoVk07OKuO0P2K5l9NJ69UAtPKCUA&oe=6AA69F7B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CnTi-8A4kDUQ7kNvwEPnUBD&_nc_oc=AdpWQLMYOteHa_k6yAqo8Sau5nE9P7xv-PfdJTe7OXubmWmfsbioBZ90WI_NvLimY6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKuhhoKlt-1hnWgCqrvLN6irR56DsfO8qu6ltpFxfQcbw&oe=6AA6A0CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q0glbwyCL9EQ7kNvwF-7Eob&_nc_oc=AdphP7eM3x23QO7SYqlq96AyCpPNJwyLLyBd7DpppfGeE3Agac288NUf-pjcVg0O9aU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLX78CUgbFwHDJ52JEqA86J6aSjML8fxTFhOtR3J6-H6Q&oe=6AA6C23E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se